{"projectInfo":{"name":"DHCPv6中继基本组网典型配置","path":"dhcpv6relay","visibility":2,"categoryId":32,"introduction":"DHCPv6客户端所在网络地址为1::/64，DHCPv6服务器的地址为2::2/64。客户端和服务器不在同一个链路范围，需要通过DHCPv6中继转发报文。DHCPv6 Relay同时作为1::/64网络的网关设备，通过RA消息中的M标志位和O标志位指定该网络中的主机通过DHCPv6获取IPv6地址和其他网络配置参数。","label":["DHCPv6"]},"deviceInfoList":[{"resourceName":"PC","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\PC.cfg"},{"resourceName":"DHCPv6-Realy","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\DHCPv6-Realy.cfg"},{"resourceName":"DHCPv6-Server","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\DHCPv6-Server.cfg"}]}